  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="has the room got any windows" data-hint="The singular subject the room takes has; move Has before the subject and use any before plural windows." data-fix="Has the room got any windows?" data-success-message="Correct. The singular have-got question moves has before the room and uses any before windows.">
    <h3>Drill 4: build the question</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">The hotel description does not mention windows. Build the have-got question about the room.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="windows">windows</button>
